 "notes": "Lambda operators/operands are checked as word tokens in the inline code; state machine definition accepted as DefinitionString or Definition object. fail_state and unknown_goes_to_default are detail while the other routing checks are core because a Choice state with no Default also fails the execution on an unmatched operator (States.NoChoiceMatched), so an explicit Fail state is the usual form but not the only one that meets the claim."
